  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>cetuximab</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>L01FE01</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>two compartments, IV dosing <small>(PK_2C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Azzopardi N et al. 2011</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>metastatic colorectal cancer patients cotreated with irinotecan and 5-fluorouracil</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>cetuximab</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_cetuximab/Cetuximab_Azzopardi2011_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>central volume of distribution V(1)</td><td>2.96</td><td>L</td><td><small>V1</small></td></tr><tr><td>peripheral volume of distribution V(2)</td><td>4.65</td><td>L</td><td><small>V2</small></td></tr><tr><td>elimination clearance CL</td><td>0.497</td><td>L/d</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>distribution clearance Q</td><td>0.836</td><td>L/d</td><td><small>Q</small></td></tr></table><h4>About cetuximab</h4><p>Cetuximab is a monoclonal antibody used to treat several cancers, mainly head and neck cancers and colorectal cancers. It is approved and authorised in the European Union, and is also being investigated for other uses.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q420296\">Wikidata Q420296</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Cetuximab\">Cetuximab</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Azzopardi N et al. (2011). Cetuximab pharmacokinetics influences progression-free survival of metastatic colorectal cancer patients. <i>Clinical cancer research : an official journal of the American Association for Cancer Research 17(19):6329–6337</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1158/1078-0432.CCR-11-1081\">10.1158/1078-0432.CCR-11-1081</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21953502\">21953502</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Azzopardi_2011: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
